    "title": "AI Effect Video Maker -Livensa",
    "description": "Type a prompt and generate a video. Let our AI magically produce a professional-quality video from your text prompts. \r\n\r\nSimply input a few keywords and let our AI do the rest. No video editing skills required.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n\r\n- Create your AI Hug: Make people hug with AI\r\n- Create your AI Avatar: Turn your images into AI avatars\r\n- Transform Text Into Video: You just type the words and our AI will create the whole story as you\u2019ve never seen before!\r\n- Realistic and Engaging: By applying smart algorithms, along with the realism features our videos will be engaging enough to force the viewers\u2019 attention to trace the events in the storyline.\r\n- Creativity At Your Fingertips: We have a big list of the themes and styles so nothing sounds like they can be similar one to another \u2013 your videos have to sound like YOU:\r\n- Share Your World: Once completing your AI masterpiece it\u2019s time to show it off with friends and family!\r\n\r\nDownload now and create videos from text in seconds with the Livensa!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.feraset.co/privacy.html\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.feraset.co/terms.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Type a prompt and generate a video. Let our AI magically produce a professional-quality video from your text prompts. <br><br>Simply input a few keywords and let our AI do the rest. No video editing skills required.<br><br>Features<br><br>- Create your AI Hug: Make people hug with AI<br>- Create your AI Avatar: Turn your images into AI avatars<br>- Transform Text Into Video: You just type the words and our AI will create the whole story as you\u2019ve never seen before!<br>- Realistic and Engaging: By applying smart algorithms, along with the realism features our videos will be engaging enough to force the viewers\u2019 attention to trace the events in the storyline.<br>- Creativity At Your Fingertips: We have a big list of the themes and styles so nothing sounds like they can be similar one to another \u2013 your videos have to sound like YOU:<br>- Share Your World: Once completing your AI masterpiece it\u2019s time to show it off with friends and family!<br><br>Download now and create videos from text in seconds with the Livensa!<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://www.feraset.co/privacy.html<br>Terms of Use: https://www.feraset.co/terms.html",
